From 5e0d2135d08a56722041a8b877624fddbccd24df Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eric Li <lizhi.xmu@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 04:39:49 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] deps: clone complete source trees (drop --sparse /
 --filter=tree:0)

Recipes cloned with `--sparse` plus `sparse-checkout set --no-cone /* !tests`. In gitignore
syntax `/*` only matches top-level entries, so sub-directories were never materialised:
ngtcp2/nghttp3 then fail with `include could not find requested file: Version` because
CMAKE_MODULE_PATH points at <src>/cmake.  Verified locally that a plain depth-1 clone does
contain cmake/Version.cmake, so materialising the whole tree is the fix.
The three intentionally narrow recipes (angle-headers / amf-headers / ...) are untouched.
---
 packages/avisynth-headers.cmake | 3 +--
 packages/brotli.cmake           | 3 +--
 packages/curl.cmake             | 3 +--
 packages/expat.cmake            | 3 +--
 packages/ffmpeg.cmake           | 3 +--
 packages/fribidi.cmake          | 3 +--
 packages/glslang.cmake          | 3 +--
 packages/harfbuzz.cmake         | 3 +--
 packages/libmysofa.cmake        | 3 +--
 packages/libpsl.cmake           | 3 +--
 packages/libsdl2.cmake          | 3 +--
 packages/libsixel.cmake         | 3 +--
 packages/libxml2.cmake          | 3 +--
 packages/nghttp3.cmake          | 3 +--
 packages/ngtcp2.cmake           | 3 +--
 packages/openssl.cmake          | 3 +--
 16 files changed, 16 insertions(+), 32 deletions(-)

diff --git a/packages/avisynth-headers.cmake b/packages/avisynth-headers.cmake
index eee0180..456bf9e 100644
